---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Editorial | roammate"
  description="How to use roammate's travel guides, understand their limitations, and report corrections."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
      "itemListElement": [
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://roammate.com/" },
        { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "Editorial", "item": "https://roammate.com/editorial/" }
      ]
    })} />
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "roammate editorial",
      "url": "https://roammate.com/editorial/",
      "parentOrganization": {
        "@type": "Organization",
        "name": "roammate",
        "url": "https://roammate.com/"
      },
      "description": "Travel guides, tips, and app comparisons published by roammate, with information about content preparation and limitations.",
      "publishingPrinciples": "https://roammate.com/editorial/",
      "logo": "https://roammate.com/images/rm-full.svg",
      "sameAs": [
        "https://www.instagram.com/roammate_travel_app",
        "https://x.com/roammate"
      ]
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <section class="ed-hero">
    <div class="ed-hero-inner">
      <nav class="ed-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span>Editorial</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-hero-title">roammate editorial</h1>
      <p class="ed-hero-subtitle">How our content is prepared, and what to check before you travel.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <article class="ed-content">
    <div class="ed-content-inner">

      <h2>Who we are</h2>

      <p>roammate editorial is the publishing name used for this site's travel guides, tips, and app comparisons. Our content workflow includes AI-assisted drafting and editing. A roammate editorial byline does not mean that an author has personally visited every destination or tested every recommendation.</p>

      <p>Use these guides as starting points for planning, not as a substitute for current advice from official authorities, transport operators, or accommodation providers. Where a guide includes source links, you can use them to check the underlying information.</p>

      <h2>Our editorial mission</h2>

      <p>We publish practical, honest travel advice for solo backpackers and independent travellers. Every piece of content exists to answer a real question someone has before, during, or after a trip. We aim to be the resource we wished we had when we started travelling.</p>

      <h2>Editorial standards</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>Check changing details</strong>: prices, timetables, entry requirements, and access conditions can change. Budget figures are planning estimates, not live quotes.</li>
        <li><strong>Understand limitations</strong>: AI-assisted content can contain mistakes. A guide's publication or update date does not guarantee that every detail has been independently rechecked on that date.</li>
        <li><strong>Report corrections</strong>: if you find outdated or inaccurate information, send the page URL and, where possible, a supporting source to <a href="mailto:support@roammate.com">support@roammate.com</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Transparency</strong>: when we compare roammate to other apps, we state clearly what roammate does and doesn't do. We link to competitors so you can evaluate them yourself.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What we cover</h2>

      <ul>
        <li><strong>City and country guides</strong>: budget breakdowns, itineraries, and practical logistics for backpacker destinations</li>
        <li><strong>Solo travel tips</strong>: how to meet people, stay safe, manage money, and navigate common challenges</li>
        <li><strong>App comparisons</strong>: honest assessments of travel companion apps and platforms, including <a href="/compare/">how roammate compares</a></li>
        <li><strong>Backpacker routes</strong>: multi-week itineraries with realistic budgets and transport details</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Questions about our content or editorial process? Reach us at <a href="mailto:support@roammate.com">support@roammate.com</a>.</p>

    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .ed-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1714 0%, #2a2420 100%);
    padding: 120px 24px 64px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ed-hero-inner {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ed-breadcrumb {
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 2.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.35);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ed-breadcrumb a {
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.55);
    transition: color 0.3s;
  }

  .ed-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  .ed-breadcrumb span {
    margin: 0 10px;
  }

  .ed-hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .ed-hero-subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: rgba(245, 240, 232, 0.65);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ed-content {
    padding: 56px 24px 80px;
  }

  .ed-content-inner {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ed-content-inner h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 40px 0 14px;
  }

  .ed-content-inner h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .ed-content-inner p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .ed-content-inner ul {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .ed-content-inner li {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .ed-content-inner a {
    color: var(--color-terracotta);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .ed-content-inner a:hover {
    color: var(--color-terracotta-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ed-hero {
      padding: 100px 20px 48px;
    }

    .ed-content {
      padding: 40px 20px 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
